# Normalize line endings on checkin so a repo-wide CRLF/LF split doesn't keep producing noisy,
# every-line diffs (see the Chunk 1 task 1 evidence: opening README.md on a machine that
# checked it out as LF showed the whole file as changed against origin, purely from line
# endings, with zero real content difference).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Diagrams/binary-ish text stay as-is either way; images and archives are binary, not diffed.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
